-Budgets/reserve, ownership, evidence identities, two-review judgment threshold, light topology, three-lesson allowance, lesson statuses and resume decisions are adjustable choices, not research-established optima. The skill does not itself protect tests, enforce billing, provide a truth oracle, learn a router or guarantee interruption control. Optional tools qualify only their actual callers and declared inputs.
-
-The identifier and conditional-reference packaging are preserved. Models/capabilities are discovered at use time; vendor rankings remain absent. Legible optional language, scoped challenges and existing authority boundaries remain practical rules. No persistent swarm, compression infrastructure or autonomous business goals are implied.
